  "task": "I need to update my address and adjust a scheduled rent payment after moving to a new apartment. First, show my current balance and personal details so I can verify them. Then, check my last 20 transactions to confirm the previous rent payments. Finally, I have a file with the new rent amount and transaction ID – use it to update both my address and the scheduled payment."
